                "text": "There\u2019s a simple deal to be made: Reopen the government, pay our public servants, & lower health care costs for hardworking Americans.\n\nIt's imperative that Republicans come back to the table to negotiate a bipartisan agreement that accomplishes all of these objectives. https://t.co/b641LLk7l0",
