                "text": "Thankful that the illegal purge of federal workers during the shutdown has been put to a stop. Now it's time to get these patriots their paychecks.\n\nI'll continue to stand up for them as House Democrats work to reopen the government & save health care.\n\nhttps://t.co/v1fCTuxZS5",
